                        <h4 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">Import Configuration</h4>
                        <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                            Restore your settings and Spotify credentials from a previously exported ZIP file. This will overwrite current configurations.
